    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Ambalangoda on the 21st day of March 2025 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 14th day of March 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation and the details of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
